### 1. Check that the backend is running
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health
Accept: application/json


### 2. Get available course levels
GET http://localhost:8080/api/lessons/levels
Accept: application/json


### 3. Get units for level A1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/lessons/levels/A1/units
Accept: application/json


### 4. Get lessons for unit 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/units/1/lessons
Accept: application/json

### Upload vocabulary, listening audio, and writing prompt
POST http://localhost:8080/api/teacher/lessons/1/resources
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="vocabulary"; filename="vocabulary.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./test-files/vocabulary.txt
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="listeningAudio"; filename="test-audio.mp3"
Content-Type: audio/mpeg

< ./test-files/test-audio.mp3
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="writingDescription"

Write five beginner-level sentences introducing yourself.
--WebAppBoundary--